 "moshi_text": "Hello, how can I help you? I got a bunch of avocados. I love how they're lush and saddy. How about you? I agree. I can't wait to start pickling some of them. By the way, I got a lot of green beans too. They're so fresh and tender. I always love having these fruits and vegetables around. It's so refreshing. I can see why they're called fruit. I'm so happy we can share this moment. It's amazing how nature provides us with so many delicious treats.",
